"description": "Genworth Financial, Inc. engages in offering mortgage and long-term care insurance products. It operates through the following segments: Enact, Long-Term Care Insurance, Life and Annuities, and Corporate and Other. The Enact segment refers to Enact Holdings that offer private mortgage insurance products. The Long-Term Care Insurance segment offers long-term care insurance products in the United States. The Life and Annuities segment focuses on protection and retirement income products. The Corporate and Other segment includes debt financing expenses. The company was founded in 1871 and is headquartered in Glen Allen, VA.",
